{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"cbc166a3-b74d-4ba3-877d-424f69917b9c","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":685431,"messageId":685431,"newsId":638046,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - fourth tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the fourth of the\n2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR, CEUX:EQNRO,\nTQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 28 October 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 29 October 2026 to no later than 1\nFebruary 2027.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 28 October 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/684948\n\nFrom 29 October to 30 October 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n265,300 own shares at an average price of NOK 441.0372 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Date              |Trading     |              |       Daily|                  |\n|                  |venue       |    Aggregated|    weighted|                  |\n|                  |            |  daily volume|     average|       Total daily|\n|                  |            |    (number of| share price| transaction value|\n|                  |            |       shares)|       (NOK)|             (NOK)|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|29 October        |OSE         |       133,000|    436.5928|     58,066,842.40|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|30 October        |OSE         |       132,300|    445.5051|     58,940,324.73|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total for the     |OSE         |              |            |                  |\n|period            |            |       265,300|    441.0372|    117,007,167.13|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Previously        |OSE         |              |            |                  |\n|disclosed buy-    +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|backs under the   |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|tranche           +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total buy-backs   |OSE         |       265,300|    441.0372|    117,007,167.13|\n|under the tranche +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|(accumulated)     |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |       265,300|    441.0372|    117,007,167.13|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n23,861,117 own shares, corresponding to 1.00% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 12,556,882 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.53% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\nInvestor relations\nBård Glad Pedersen, senior vice president Investor Relations,\n+47 918 01 791\n\nMedia\nSissel Rinde, vice president Media Relations,\n+47 412 60 584\n","category":[{"id":1007,"category_no":"UTSTEDERS MELDEPLIKT VED HANDEL I EGNE AKSJER","category_en":"ACQUISITION OR DISPOSAL OF AN ISSUER'S OWN SHARES"}],"markets":["XOSL"],"issuerId":1309,"correctionForMessageId":0,"correctedByMessageId":0,"issuerSign":"EQNR","issuerName":"Equinor ASA","instrId":0,"instrumentName":"","instrumentFullName":"","publishedTime":"2026-11-03T07:00:05.164Z","test":false,"numbAttachments":1,"attachments":[{"id":335571,"name":"Detailed overview of transactions.pdf"}],"clientAnnouncementId":"921c4ff9-dc29-41c8-9213-64133921f4f8","infoRequired":1,"oamMandatory":1}}}